+    // S81-SHLK s10b (2026-10-19, s10 textbook: st_row[0] -> st_row[31] 32-b ripple increment, 19 levels ~690 ps):
+    // st_row / st_left step as lo 4 + hi 28 bits.  The lo nibble steps in the cycle; the hi word takes a REGISTERED
